Package: oocap
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign LINUX CAPABILITIES
 Inspects, drops, and verifies Linux thread capability bounding sets.
 Pure openOODA implementation with zero ambient authority, dual POSIX CLI,
 and Model Context Protocol (MCP) streaming server.
